jobs.description:
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the opportunity&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Please Note:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;For ease of assessment, please include a portfolio alongside your CV in English when applying.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;We accept portfolios in multiple formats (PDF, website, or online portfolio platform).&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;This is a mandatory requirement.&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are seeking a Product Designer with extensive experience in designing both complex internal systems and user-facing applications. Your mission will be to deeply understand the workflows, challenges, and goals of our users across multiple departments. By designing thoughtful, end-to-end experiences, you will empower them to do their best work. In this role, you will collaborate with cross-functional teams to strengthen our organisation through intelligent automation and deliver scalable value for customer risk lifecycle management.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About&amp;nbsp; the team:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You will be part of an ecosystem focused on keeping our user secure:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;CRL: Customer Risk Lifecycle focuses on building a secure, compliant-by-design environment to manage the customer risk lifecycle through AI integration, internal system optimisation, and thoughtful app design. Our vision is to redefine the future of customer risk management to enable safe banking&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;In this role, you will:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Drive the end-to-end design process: Take responsibility for the entire design process from initial research with users to conceptualisation, design, testing, and validation of operational solutions.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Design for efficiency and effectiveness: Create solutions that prioritise usability, speed, and functionality for power users who interact with complex systems daily.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Simplify regulatory complexity: Transform compliance requirements into intuitive workflows, ensuring that security and risk management are native parts of the user experience.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborate cross-functionally: Work together with Product Managers, Engineers, and operations leads to turn user insights into product opportunities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you need to be successful:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience: 3+ years of experience designing digital products, with a focus on both internal platforms and app design.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Systems thinking: Proven ability to solve for complexity and navigate system constraints and intricate user workflows.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;User research: Experience conducting research with internal stakeholders and translating findings into actionable design solutions.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;AI Familiarity: Understanding of how automation and AI can augment internal team capabilities.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;User centricity: A user-centered mindset with a passion for solving practical, often messy, real world problems that involve system constraints, legacy infrastructure and complex user workflows.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strategic design: Demonstrated understanding of how design can drive operational efficiency and solve internal process challenges. &lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Design advocacy: Ability to work collaboratively with non-design audiences and communicate design rationale and value clearly.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Analytical mindset: Proven ability to use data and user feedback to identify product opportunities and measure UX success.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Nice to have&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Having deep expertise in architecting complex solutions for highly regulated environments like fintech, healthcare, and logistics. Experienced in designing both end-user mobile apps and secure internal tools, balancing complex operational requirements and strict compliance with an intuitive user experience&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What’s in it for you:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Accelerate your career growth by joining one of Europe’s most talked about disruptors 🚀.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Employee benefits that range from a competitive personal development budget, work from home budget, discounts to fitness &amp;amp; wellness memberships, language apps and public transportation.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;As an N26 employee you will have access to a Premium subscription on your personal N26 bank account. As well as subscriptions for friends and family members.&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Additional day of annual leave for each year of service.&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A high degree of autonomy and access to cutting edge technologies - all while working with a friendly team of peers of diverse nationalities, experiences, and backgrounds.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A relocation package with visa support for those who need it.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Who we are&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;N26 has reimagined banking for today’s digital world. Technology and design empower&lt;a href=&quot;https://n26.com/en-eu/blog&quot;&gt; everything we do&lt;/a&gt; and it’s how we are building the global banking platform the world loves to use.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We&#39;ve eliminated physical branches, paperwork, and hidden fees for an elegant digital experience and supreme savings. Giving people the power to live and bank their way is what gets us out of bed in the morning and inspires the work that we do.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are headquartered in Berlin with offices in multiple cities across Europe, including Vienna and Barcelona, and a 1,500-strong team of more than 80 nationalities.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Do you see yourself thriving in this role? &lt;/strong&gt;We’d love to see your application even if you don’t meet 100% of the criteria. You may just be the right fit for this or other roles!&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Equal opportunities for all&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At N26, we believe our strength lies in our people and the varied perspectives they bring. We strive to build diverse teams that drive innovation and business success. We actively seek talent from all backgrounds and welcome applications from all genders, cultures, sexual orientations, abilities, neurodiversities, and ages.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are committed to providing an excellent and accessible candidate experience. If you require any accommodations to make this process work for you, please let us know. We’re here to support you!&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Discover more about Diversity &amp;amp; Inclusion at N26:&lt;a href=&quot;https://n26.com/en-eu/diversity-and-inclusion&quot;&gt; https://n26.com/en-eu/diversity-and-inclusion&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Join our R&amp;amp;D Tech Hub in Warsaw&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We’re building a new R&amp;amp;D Tech Hub in Poland and are looking for people who want to make a real impact from day one. You’ll be part of a globally connected team, helping to shape the culture and ways of working at our new location. This is a hands-on role in a supportive environment, where collaboration, learning, and adaptability are key.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We value practical problem-solving, diverse perspectives, and people who take ownership. If you&#39;re ready to contribute to meaningful projects and help lay the foundation for a growing team, we’d like to hear from you.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the role: What&#39;s in the Box&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;HelloFresh is searching for an action-oriented servant leader&amp;nbsp; for our warehouse management system (WMS) Software Engineering and Product functions. This leader owns the full software delivery lifecycle for HelloFresh&#39;s global&amp;nbsp; warehouse fulfillment and inventory control domain — from architecture and product design through engineering execution, quality assurance, and operational reliability. You will drive a culture of product &amp;amp; engineering excellence, leveraging modern agentic tooling and AI-assisted workflows to increase team velocity, reduce defect escape rates, and accelerate deployment confidence.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You will collaborate closely with stakeholders across technology, operations, automation/production technology, procurement, and finance to deliver innovative solutions on our strategic WMS platform — Infios&#39;s Warehouse Advantage (Körber/Highjump) — while balancing competing priorities and technical resource demand.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The &lt;strong&gt;Director of WMS Engineering and Product will&lt;/strong&gt; work with key technology and product leaders across HelloFresh to enable the inventory management and control domain strategy, evaluate technology-related priorities, and translate stakeholder needs into actionable roadmaps. The ideal candidate combines impeccable management and communication skills with a practitioner&#39;s instinct for modern software delivery — knowing how to build high-performing teams, establish engineering health metrics, and integrate AI-assisted tooling that meaningfully accelerates quality and velocity.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you’ll do: The Recipe&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;WMS Solution Ownership: &lt;/strong&gt;Provide technical direction, development oversight, and performance accountability for HelloFresh&#39;s deployment of Infios&#39;s Warehouse Advantage (Körber/Highjump) WMS platform across all global locations&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Integration Architecture &amp;amp; Reliability: &lt;/strong&gt;Drive WMS application layer Integration architecture to upstream tooling and host systems via CI/CD pipelines [Debezium/Kafka to Snowflake/Databricks]&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Platform Architecture: &lt;/strong&gt;Partner/ support as needed the Hosting Architecture team in the optimal sizing and performance of WMS Architecture in AWS&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Agentic Engineering &amp;amp; Developer Productivity: &lt;/strong&gt;Champion and drive adoption of agentic engineering practices across the team: automated code review tooling (e.g., AI-assisted PR analysis, static analysis agents, LLM-powered code quality gates), AI-augmented test generation and execution, and intelligent deployment pipelines. Measure and report the impact of these practices on delivery velocity and defect escape rate&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;CI/CD &amp;amp; Deployment Automation: &lt;/strong&gt;Own the maturity roadmap for CI/CD pipelines. Establish automated deployment workflows with robust rollback strategies, feature flagging, environment-specific gate checks, and infrastructure-as-code practices — enabling high-confidence, low-friction releases across all WMS environments&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Quality Engineering &amp;amp; Test Automation: &lt;/strong&gt;Partner with WMS Services and Support leadership to build a world-class QA function. Drive adoption of automated regression suites, AI-assisted edge case generation, and contract testing for integrations. Push teams beyond happy-path coverage toward comprehensive scenario validation, including automated performance and load testing for peak fulfillment periods&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Engineering Metrics &amp;amp; Continuous Improvement: &lt;/strong&gt;Establish DORA metrics (deployment frequency, lead time for change, change failure rate, and mean time to restore) as the foundation of engineering health reporting for the WMS organization. Set baselines, publish improvement targets, and use metric trends to identify bottlenecks, prioritize tooling and process investments, and communicate engineering performance to senior leadership&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Technical Roadmap &amp;amp; Architecture Governance: &lt;/strong&gt;Partner with peers and senior leadership on architectural decision-making for WMS platform evolution, integration patterns, and technology transitions. Champion the use of structured design reviews to maintain coherent, scalable technical direction. Lead evaluations to refactor or replace legacy systems, including risk mitigation and transition planning&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Vendor &amp;amp; Capacity Management: &lt;/strong&gt;Work with department leadership to source and partner with 3rd-party vendors to augment internal engineering capacity and expertise. Maintain vendor performance accountability and ensure structured knowledge transfer to build durable internal capability&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;People Leadership &amp;amp; Talent Development: &lt;/strong&gt;Coach, develop, and retain high-performing engineers, product managers, and team leads. Partner with HR and Talent Acquisition to build organizational depth — playing an active role in recruiting, onboarding, and career development&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;International Standardization/ Release Consolidation. &lt;/strong&gt;Partner with departmental leadership, peer domains,&amp;nbsp; and executive leadership to own the long term roadmap for product consolidation to a single application release version administered globally&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Cross-functional Leadership. &lt;/strong&gt;Serve on both the Fulfillment Technology and overall Automation &amp;amp; Technology leadership teams, reinforcing HelloFresh DNA values, establishing KPIs, and prioritizing strategic initiatives at a departmental level&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you’ll bring: The Ingredients&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Technical/Engineering Experience&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;10+ years of warehouse management system (WMS) software engineering and implementation experience with a tier-one WMS in an RF-based distribution, manufacturing, or e-commerce fulfillment environment&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;3+ years of direct hands-on experience with Infios&#39;s Warehouse Advantage (Körber/Highjump) WMS platform with SQL Server&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;3+ years managing application integrations via microservices and associated toolsets, including REST APIs, event-driven architectures, and ETL pipelines&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrated experience implementing or scaling CI/CD pipelines, including automated testing gates, deployment automation, and infrastructure-as-code (IaC) practices across multi-environment WMS or fulfillment technology stacks&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hands-on familiarity with agentic and AI-assisted engineering tools — including automated code review platforms, AI-assisted test generation, and LLM-powered developer productivity tools (e.g., GitHub Copilot, CodeRabbit, SonarQube AI, or equivalent) — with a track record of driving meaningful team-wide adoption and measurable impact&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience defining and tracking engineering delivery and quality metrics (DORA metrics or equivalent) and using data to drive process improvement and leadership reporting&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience leading evaluations to refactor or replace legacy systems, including developing and executing technology transition plans with appropriate risk mitigation strategies&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Product Experience&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience leading a design and product process that scales a digital technology operations ecosystem across volume growth, multiple brands, and new digital properties&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strategic thinker with the ability to build and execute innovative digital product strategy while executing tactically against multiple competing priorities simultaneously&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven ability to translate business requirements into technical specifications, roadmaps, and delivery plans — and to communicate progress and tradeoffs clearly to both technical and non-technical stakeholders&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrated ability to build leadership support for proactive technology investments, making the business case for engineering quality, automation, and platform modernization&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Above all, we are looking for people who will &lt;strong&gt;make HelloFresh Group better.&lt;/strong&gt; We believe there are many different ways of developing skills and we love diverse experiences! So even if you don’t “tick all the boxes” but think you’d thrive in this role, we would really like to learn more about you.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What we offer: The Toppings&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Health - &lt;/strong&gt;You’re covered from your first day with&amp;nbsp; private health insurance.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Flexible Working - &lt;/strong&gt;We work in-office 3 days a week to align on goals, with flexible hours to support work-life balance and personal needs&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Time Off - &lt;/strong&gt;You receive 26 days of paid vacation each year, providing you time to rest and recharge.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Learning and Development - &lt;/strong&gt;An annual Learning &amp;amp; Development budget and a Mentoring Program to support your ongoing professional growth.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Employee Referral Program - &lt;/strong&gt;Our team members can take part in our internal employee referral program and receive a bonus for recommending successful candidates to open roles.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Daily Comforts - &lt;/strong&gt;Free coffee, drinks, and fresh fruit are available to keep you refreshed throughout the day.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;4&quot;&gt;At HelloFresh, the goal is to change the way people eat forever by delivering high-quality food across 18 countries and 3 continents. As a global food solutions group and the world&#39;s leading meal kit provider, the portfolio includes HelloFresh, Green Chef, EveryPlate, Chefs Plate, Factor_, Youfoodz, Good Chop, and The Pets Table.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;5&quot;&gt;Engaging with HelloFresh in Warsaw means collaborating with &lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;5&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;60&quot;&gt;HelloTech&lt;/strong&gt;—a global technology division of over 1,000 people powering an end-to-end food ecosystem. From digital personalization and forecasting to supply chain optimization and food waste reduction, technology drives every step of this direct-to-consumer model. HelloTech operates in autonomous, cross-functional alliances, with each team holding full accountability for a specific domain. By collaborating with the Warsaw office, the service provider will leverage a modern tech stack and work with international teams to shape scalable, data-driven platforms that impact millions of global customers.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2 data-path-to-node=&quot;7&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;7&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;About the Role: What&#39;s in the Box&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;8&quot;&gt;HelloFresh Group is building the next generation of consumer experiences across its portfolio—from discovery and personalization to shopping and subscription management. The Consumer UX team is at the heart of this work, designing end-to-end experiences that are simple, delightful, and grounded in real customer needs.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;9&quot;&gt;Services are required for Senior UX Designers across two squad contexts: one embedded in &lt;strong&gt;Good Chop&lt;/strong&gt;, the premium American meat and seafood subscription brand, and one in the &lt;strong&gt;central Consumer UX team&lt;/strong&gt; working across the broader HelloFresh Group portfolio. Both roles share the same craft bar, strategic expectations, and ways of working.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;10&quot;&gt;These are full-accountability roles inside a fast-paced environment. The provider will partner with Product and Engineering leads on a cross-functional squad, where UX serves as a strategic input to shape direction from the start. This role does not include people management responsibilities.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2 data-path-to-node=&quot;12&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;12&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;What You’ll Do: The Recipe&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li data-path-to-node=&quot;13,0,0&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;13,0,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Consumer Experience Design:&lt;/strong&gt; Lead design from concept to shipped product, maintaining full accountability for the consumer experience across touchpoints while holding a high quality bar at every stage.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-path-to-node=&quot;13,1,0&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;13,1,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Strategy and Roadmap Influence:&lt;/strong&gt; Frame problem spaces before briefs are created. Bring evidence-backed consumer insights into squad planning to surface opportunities and inform what gets built.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-path-to-node=&quot;13,2,0&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;13,2,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Craft and Execution:&lt;/strong&gt; Maintain a high personal standard across UI, interaction design, motion, micro-interaction, and UX writing, using animation and motion as intentional strategic tools.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-path-to-node=&quot;13,3,0&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;13,3,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;AI-Native Workflow:&lt;/strong&gt; Utilize AI across the entire design lifecycle—including insight synthesis, discovery, rapid prototyping, and design-to-code workflows—to increase execution speed and precision.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2 data-path-to-node=&quot;15&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;15&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;What You’ll Bring: The Ingredients&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li data-path-to-node=&quot;16,0,0&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;16,0,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Experience:&lt;/strong&gt; 6+ years in product design, with a proven track record delivering high-quality consumer products end-to-end.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-path-to-node=&quot;16,1,0&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;16,1,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Consumer Instinct:&lt;/strong&gt; Deep understanding of consumer-facing products and decision-making drivers across the full customer lifecycle. Subscription domain experience is a plus.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-path-to-node=&quot;16,2,0&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;16,2,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Strategic Range:&lt;/strong&gt; Ability to define problem spaces before designing solutions, utilizing evidence to refine project scopes and contribute to roadmap strategies.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-path-to-node=&quot;16,3,0&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;16,3,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Craft Mastery:&lt;/strong&gt; Exceptional visual and interaction design skills with deep focus on hierarchy, motion, micro-interaction, and animation. High proficiency in Figma and strong familiarity with front-end technical constraints.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-path-to-node=&quot;16,4,0&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;16,4,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;High Agency:&lt;/strong&gt; Proactivity to advocate for optimal design solutions, bringing conviction to decisions and collaborating effectively with cross-functional partners.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-path-to-node=&quot;16,5,0&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;16,5,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Research Fluency:&lt;/strong&gt; Ability to frame research questions, run lightweight studies, and translate findings into design direction.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-path-to-node=&quot;16,6,0&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;16,6,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;AI-Native in Practice:&lt;/strong&gt; Active use of AI tools (such as Figma AI and Claude) in live project workflows for synthesis, discovery, prototyping, and code generation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-path-to-node=&quot;16,7,0&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;16,7,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Communication:&lt;/strong&gt; Clear presentation capabilities, skill in facilitating cross-functional alignment, and the ability to defend design decisions using data and evidence.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2 data-path-to-node=&quot;18&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;18&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;What We Offer: The Toppings&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li data-path-to-node=&quot;19,0,0&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;19,0,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Global collaboration at scale:&lt;/strong&gt; Collaborate with experienced engineers and product partners across HelloTech’s international teams, in a culture of active knowledge sharing.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-path-to-node=&quot;19,1,0&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;19,1,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Technology with real-world impact:&lt;/strong&gt; Build and operate modern systems at global scale, supporting millions of customers and complex supply chain operations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-path-to-node=&quot;19,2,0&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;19,2,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Technical/Product/Design leadership:&lt;/strong&gt; Drive best practices and influence design quality, architecture, and ways of working in an autonomous, product-led setup.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-path-to-node=&quot;19,3,0&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;19,3,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;End-to-end development/delivery:&lt;/strong&gt; Drive decisions from problem definition to production, improving systems and enabling long-term scalability.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-path-to-node=&quot;19,4,0&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;19,4,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Access to workspace at Warsaw Centre Point:&lt;/strong&gt; The hub offers modern facilities including showers, breakout zones, outdoor space, cycle parking, and refreshments (coffee, soft drinks, and fruit).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;21&quot;&gt;#PRODUCT #DESIGN&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;h1&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About Scale AI&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Scale AI accelerates the development and deployment of AI, from the high-quality training data and evaluation services that power the world&#39;s leading AI labs, to full-stack AI applications built for Enterprise, U.S. Public Sector, and Global Public Sector customers. We don&#39;t just hand over a model; we find the highest-value use case, build the system around it, and own the outcome, whether that&#39;s an agent supporting mission planning for the Department of Defense, a sovereign AI platform for a government ministry, or an agentic workflow inside a Fortune 500 enterprise. Our platform powers breakthroughs at the frontier of AI, and great design is how we make that power accessible, intuitive, and trusted by the teams who rely on it every day.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h1&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The Role&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We&#39;re looking for a product design leader to lead and grow our enterprise team.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h1&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You&#39;ll Do&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Set the direction for Enterprise design.&lt;/strong&gt; Define what exceptional design looks like for Scale&#39;s Applications customers making high-stakes decisions and for the expert contributors powering the platform. Translate the broader design vision into a clear, motivating direction for your team.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Build and lead the team.&lt;/strong&gt; Own hiring, development, and day-to-day leadership for a growing team of designers. Create the culture and operating rhythms that let them do their best work.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Drive design execution across the Enterprise product.&lt;/strong&gt; Partner with your Product and Engineering counterparts to set priorities and ensure design is involved from problem scoping through delivery, not brought in at the end.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Raise the craft bar.&lt;/strong&gt; Uphold design principles and quality standards on your team. Push designers beyond digitizing workflows toward genuinely rethinking how people work with AI. Hold the line on quality without slowing delivery.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Contribute to the design system.&lt;/strong&gt; Help shape and adopt Scale&#39;s shared design system, championing consistent component use and contributing patterns back so a distributed team can build coherently at speed.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Ground the team in user needs.&lt;/strong&gt; Build the research habits and cadences that keep your team&#39;s decisions rooted in what enterprise customers and users actually need, and advocate for that discipline with your Product and Engineering partners.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Shape Scale&#39;s approach to human-agent interaction.&lt;/strong&gt; Scale&#39;s core value is human-in-the-loop AI, and the interface is where trust is built or lost. Help define the interaction patterns for how enterprise users work alongside AI agents, and contribute to Scale&#39;s growing point of view on this emerging space.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h1&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Who you are&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;3+ years managing product design teams&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven track record of simplifying data-dense, power-user workflows into elegant solutions for B2B and beyond&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Deeply customer-centric, with a track record of grounding design decisions in real user needs and business impact&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Fluent in how AI is changing design practice and tooling; building AI-native workflows for your team&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience designing for agentic platforms, and excited to shape the future of interaction patterns for AI and human-in-the-loop systems&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Balance speed and quality; you know how to prioritize ruthlessly and get the team shipping without dropping the craft bar&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent communicator. You can present to a leaders and a front-line PM and make both feel heard&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;1,1,0&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;PLEASE NOTE:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;Our policy requires a 90-day waiting period before reconsidering candidates for the same role. This allows us to ensure a fair and thorough evaluation of all applicants.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About Us:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;At Scale, our mission is to develop reliable AI systems for the world&#39;s most important decisions. Our products provide the high-quality data and full-stack technologies that power the world&#39;s leading models, and help enterprises and governments build, deploy, and oversee AI applications that deliver real impact. We work closely with industry leaders like Meta, &lt;/em&gt;&lt;em&gt;Ernst&lt;/em&gt;&lt;em&gt; &lt;/em&gt;&lt;em&gt;&amp;amp;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;em&gt; Young, Mayo Clinic, Time Inc., the Government of Qatar, and U.S. government agencies including the Army and Air Force. We are expanding our team to accelerate the development of AI applications.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;We believe that everyone should be able to bring their whole selves to work, which is why we are proud to be an inclusive and equal opportunity workplace. We are committed to equal employment opportunity regardless of race, color, ancestry, religion, sex, national origin, sexual orientation, age, citizenship, marital status, disability status, gender identity or Veteran status.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;We are committed to working with and providing reasonable accommodations to applicants with physical and mental disabilities. If you need assistance and/or a reasonable accommodation in the application or recruiting process due to a disability, please contact us at accommodations@scale.com. Please see the United States Department of Labor&#39;s &lt;/em&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.eeoc.gov/sites/default/files/2023-06/22-088_EEOC_KnowYourRights6.12ScreenRdr.pdf&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;Know Your Rights poster&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;em&gt; for additional information.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;We comply with the United States Department of Labor&#39;s &lt;/em&gt;&lt;em&gt;Pay Transparency provision&lt;/em&gt;&lt;em&gt;.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;strong&gt;PLEASE NOTE: &lt;/strong&gt;We collect, retain and use personal data for our professional business purposes, including notifying you of job opportunities that may be of interest and sharing with our affiliates. We limit the personal data we collect to that which we believe is appropriate and necessary to manage applicants’ needs, provide our services, and comply with applicable laws. Any information we collect in connection with your application will be treated in accordance with our internal policies and programs designed to protect personal data. Please see our &lt;a href=&quot;https://scale.com/legal/privacy&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;privacy policy&lt;/a&gt; for additional information.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;

&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About Druva&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;Druva is the resilience foundation for the AI enterprise, helping organizations secure and recover from connected risk across data, cyber, identity, and AI. The Resilience Cloud is a fully managed, cloud-native SaaS platform that delivers air-gapped and immutable protection across cloud, SaaS, on-premises, endpoint, and edge environments. Powered by Dru MetaGraph, Druva’s graph-powered intelligence layer, the platform connects critical business context so customers can understand risk, respond faster, recover cleanly, and govern data with greater confidence.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Trusted by nearly 7,500 customers, including 75 of the Fortune 500, Druva helps safeguard the critical information and systems businesses depend on in an increasingly connected world.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Visit&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.druva.com/&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;druva.com&lt;/a&gt;&amp;nbsp;and follow us on&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.linkedin.com/company/druva/mycompany/&quot;&gt;LinkedIn&lt;/a&gt;,&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://twitter.com/druvainc&quot;&gt;X&lt;/a&gt;&amp;nbsp;and&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.facebook.com/DruvaInc/&quot;&gt;Facebook&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are looking for a User Experience Designer to help us shape the design of new features and enhancements. This person should have a passion for usability, an eye for visual consistency, and a knack for reducing complex problems to simple,&amp;nbsp;intuitive experiences.&amp;nbsp;&lt;br&gt;The ideal candidate will be comfortable working in a fast-evolving product environment and have an interest in how emerging technologies, including AI, can be thoughtfully incorporated into user experiences.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Responsibilities:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Initiate, suggest, and spearhead major UI refactoring initiatives to create an intuitive and consistent user experience.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Design elegant solutions to complex workflows and product challenges.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Act as the user advocate throughout the development process, subjecting early-stage designs to usability testing or expert review and offering implementation suggestions from a user-centered perspective.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Act as the “go-to” person with in-depth knowledge of user interface best practices, design standards, and emerging UX patterns.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Use research-related services, theories, and methods to support design recommendations and decisions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop wireframes, prototypes, behavioral specifications, personas, and other UX deliverables.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Learn from user research, usability studies, analytics, and user feedback to continuously improve product experiences.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Keep the interface beautiful, consistent, accessible, and easy to use. Direct the visual appearance of new features and enhancements across our software applications.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborate closely with product managers, engineers, researchers, and other stakeholders to translate user and business needs into effective product experiences.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Contribute to the design of AI-enabled product experiences, ensuring that AI interactions are intuitive, transparent, predictable, and aligned with user needs.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Explore and apply emerging AI-assisted design and research tools where they can improve design exploration, prototyping, research synthesis, or overall design efficiency.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Help identify opportunities where AI can simplify complex workflows and create meaningful improvements to the user experience.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Qualifications:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Graduate/Master’s degree in Design or a related field from premier institutes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A strong portfolio that demonstrates your design process, problem-solving approach, and ability to translate complex requirements into intuitive user experiences.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;3–5 years of experience working on UX for software products, web applications, mobile applications, and/or complex websites.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong understanding of user-centered design principles, interaction design, information architecture, usability, and visual design.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to develop UX deliverables such as workflows, early conceptual designs, wireframes, prototypes, usability improvements, mock-ups, and style guides.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to work effectively with business, product, engineering, and other cross-functional teams.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with AI-enabled design/research tools and the ability to thoughtfully evaluate where AI can improve the design process or user experience is a plus.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;회사 소개&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233279&amp;quot;:true,&amp;quot;134245417&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:240,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:240}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;ewa-rteLine&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;ewa-rteLine&quot;&gt;쿠팡페이의 핀테크 사업은 금융 서비스의 재정의를 통해 쿠팡 고객과 판매자들이 동일한 비용으로 더 많은 가치를 누리도록 지원합니다.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;ewa-rteLine&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;ewa-rteLine&quot;&gt;쿠팡페이는 쿠팡 앱 및 홈페이지에서 상품을 구매하는 소비자와 쿠팡 마켓플레이스에서 사업을 영위하는 판매자, 쿠팡이츠에 입점한 음식점주 등에게 혁신적인 결제 및 금융 솔루션을 제공하는 데 최선을 다합니다. 쿠팡페이의 최신 핀테크 혁신 기술은 원터치 결제 서비스가 탑재된 자체 결제 시스템 쿠페이를 기반으로 한국과 대만 소비자들의 니즈에 부응하고 있습니다.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;ewa-rteLine&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;ewa-rteLine&quot;&gt;대표적으로 쿠팡페이는 고객 가치 지향 차원에서 업계 최고 수준의 리워드를 제공하는 쿠팡와우카드(쿠팡 전용 제휴 카드)를 빠르게 확장시키고 있습니다. 또 마켓플레이스 판매자들을 위해 BaaS (Banking as a Service) 모델을 접목하고 다양한 유동성 강화 솔루션을 제공함으로써 소상공인들의 사업 성장을 적극 지원합니다.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;ewa-rteLine&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;ewa-rteLine&quot;&gt;보유하고 계신 다양한 경험을 핀테크 분야에서 최대한 살리고 싶다면 쿠팡페이와 함께 하세요. 쿠팡페이는 고객들의 결제 시간을 최대한 아껴주고 좋아하는 것을 마음껏 쇼핑할 시간을 벌어드립니다.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;직무 소개&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233279&amp;quot;:true,&amp;quot;134245417&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:240,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:240}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Coupang Pay UX팀은 쿠팡에서 상품을 구매하는 고객부터 판매자 까지 쿠팡의 플랫폼을 이용하는 모든 이들에게 혁신적인 결제 및 금융 서비스를 통해 더 나은 경험을 선사하는 데 집중하고 있습니다. Coupang Pay의 프로덕트(UX) 디자이너는 아이데이션과 설계, UI 디자인, 개발 조직과의 협업까지 전 과정의 end to end 업무를 수행하며, 프로덕트 제작의 전 과정을 책임집니다. 구매 고객 뿐만 아니라 판매자까지 다양한 고객의 특성을 고려하고 비즈니스 요구사항을 이해하여 가장 효과적인 디자인을 제안합니다. 정성적, 정량적 데이터를 기반으로 체계적으로 사고하며 설득력있는 전략을 제시합니다.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;업무 내용&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233279&amp;quot;:true,&amp;quot;134245417&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:240,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:240}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li data-leveltext=&quot;&quot; data-font=&quot;Symbol&quot; data-listid=&quot;10&quot; data-list-defn-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335552541&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335559685&amp;quot;:720,&amp;quot;335559991&amp;quot;:360,&amp;quot;469769226&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;Symbol&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469769242&amp;quot;:[8226],&amp;quot;469777803&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;left&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777804&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777815&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;hybridMultilevel&amp;quot;}&quot; data-aria-posinset=&quot;1&quot; data-aria-level=&quot;1&quot;&gt;소비자/판매자를 위한 혁신적인 금융 서비스 설계를 위해 프로덕트, 비지니스, 데이터, 엔지니어링팀과 커뮤니케이션하며 전반적인 디자인 프로젝트를 리드&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-leveltext=&quot;&quot; data-font=&quot;Symbol&quot; data-listid=&quot;10&quot; data-list-defn-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335552541&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335559685&amp;quot;:720,&amp;quot;335559991&amp;quot;:360,&amp;quot;469769226&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;Symbol&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469769242&amp;quot;:[8226],&amp;quot;469777803&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;left&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777804&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777815&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;hybridMultilevel&amp;quot;}&quot; data-aria-posinset=&quot;1&quot; data-aria-level=&quot;1&quot;&gt;제품 비전과 로드맵 수립에 적극 참여하고 전략적 의사결정에 기여&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-leveltext=&quot;&quot; data-font=&quot;Symbol&quot; data-listid=&quot;10&quot; data-list-defn-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335552541&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335559685&amp;quot;:720,&amp;quot;335559991&amp;quot;:360,&amp;quot;469769226&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;Symbol&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469769242&amp;quot;:[8226],&amp;quot;469777803&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;left&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777804&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777815&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;hybridMultilevel&amp;quot;}&quot; data-aria-posinset=&quot;1&quot; data-aria-level=&quot;1&quot;&gt;As-is 프로덕트, 서비스의 문제점을 발굴하고 분석하여 사용자 경험 개선 방향 제시&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;자격&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;Apple-converted-space&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;요건&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233279&amp;quot;:true,&amp;quot;134245417&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:240,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:240}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li data-leveltext=&quot;&quot; data-font=&quot;Symbol&quot; data-listid=&quot;9&quot; data-list-defn-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335552541&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335559685&amp;quot;:720,&amp;quot;335559991&amp;quot;:360,&amp;quot;469769226&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;Symbol&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469769242&amp;quot;:[8226],&amp;quot;469777803&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;left&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777804&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777815&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;hybridMultilevel&amp;quot;}&quot; data-aria-posinset=&quot;1&quot; data-aria-level=&quot;1&quot;&gt;애플리케이션 디자인 및 서비스 출시 경험이 있는 분&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-leveltext=&quot;&quot; data-font=&quot;Symbol&quot; data-listid=&quot;9&quot; data-list-defn-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335552541&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335559685&amp;quot;:720,&amp;quot;335559991&amp;quot;:360,&amp;quot;469769226&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;Symbol&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469769242&amp;quot;:[8226],&amp;quot;469777803&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;left&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777804&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777815&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;hybridMultilevel&amp;quot;}&quot; data-aria-posinset=&quot;1&quot; data-aria-level=&quot;1&quot;&gt;최소한 end-to-end 프로덕트 디자인 경험(UI &amp;amp; UX)이 7년 이상이신 분&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-leveltext=&quot;&quot; data-font=&quot;Symbol&quot; data-listid=&quot;9&quot; data-list-defn-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335552541&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335559685&amp;quot;:720,&amp;quot;335559991&amp;quot;:360,&amp;quot;469769226&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;Symbol&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469769242&amp;quot;:[8226],&amp;quot;469777803&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;left&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777804&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777815&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;hybridMultilevel&amp;quot;}&quot; data-aria-posinset=&quot;1&quot; data-aria-level=&quot;1&quot;&gt;타이포그라피, 인터랙션 디자인, 시각 디자인 및 사용자 연구를 잘 보여주는 우수한 포트폴리오&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-leveltext=&quot;&quot; data-font=&quot;Symbol&quot; data-listid=&quot;9&quot; data-list-defn-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335552541&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335559685&amp;quot;:720,&amp;quot;335559991&amp;quot;:360,&amp;quot;469769226&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;Symbol&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469769242&amp;quot;:[8226],&amp;quot;469777803&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;left&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777804&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777815&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;hybridMultilevel&amp;quot;}&quot; data-aria-posinset=&quot;1&quot; data-aria-level=&quot;1&quot;&gt;피그마, 어도비 등 디자인 툴을 능숙하게 사용하는 능력을 보유하신 분&lt;/li&gt;
